          "text": "Many students in the UK choose to work part-time while pursuing their undergraduate or postgraduate studies. For some, it’s a way to support their living expenses, while others see it as an opportunity to explore the culture, meet new people, and build professional connections. Whatever your reason, part-time work can be a valuable experience if you follow the right rules and choose the right job."
